NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

This license covers the source code in this repository only. The cascade
mechanism it implements originates from prior work by Wei, Ni, Zhao, Gan and
Cohan ("Step-level Optimization for Efficient Computer-use Agents", 2026).
That upstream repository carries no license, so no code from it was copied
here; this is an independent implementation based on the published mechanism.

The ModernBERT monitor weights are distributed by their original authors under
their own terms and are used here for academic reproduction only.

See the "References & Acknowledgements" section of README.md for details.
